      "problem": "$2\\sqrt{y}+7\\sqrt{y}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt{y}$ terms together, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{y}+7\\sqrt{y} & = \\\\ (2+7)\\sqrt{y} & = \\\\ 9\\sqrt{y} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
