    "q-34206": {
      "dom_id": "step-q34206",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Simplify $\\sqrt{192z}-\\sqrt{147z}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We simplify each of the radical terms using the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{192z}-\\sqrt{147z} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{64\\cdot 3z}-\\sqrt{49\\cdot 3z} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{64}\\cdot \\sqrt{3z}-\\sqrt{49}\\cdot \\sqrt{3z} & = \\\\ 8\\sqrt{3z}-7\\sqrt{3z} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8\\sqrt{3z}-7\\sqrt{3z} & = \\\\ (8-7)\\sqrt{3z} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{3z} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
